rooms_desc ({"Oh yeah,this is my room.I have a computer and many books.Mostly fantasy,butI also like Isaac Asimov's Foundation-books.You can see a fridge in the cornerIt is filled with nourishing food and Bounty chocolates.A long bed is before the east wall.You know,I'm nearly 7 feet tall.You notice a small paper on thewall,over the bed.It reads:\"E-mail:s5062end@sun10.vsz.bme.hu.Favourite Mud:Midnight Island,152.66.86.4 6666(under building yet).Girlfriend:none.\"drink beerThis is my best advice to you...","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
